LUT-y Retro-Film (katalog core/engine/src/main/assets/luts/ oraz luts/)
=====================================================================

Utwór zależny od: RawTherapee Film Simulation Collection (HaldCLUT)
Autorzy oryginału: Pat David, Pavlov Dmitry, Michael Ezra
Źródło: https://rawpedia.rawtherapee.com/Film_Simulation
        (archiwum: https://rawtherapee.com/shared/HaldCLUT.zip)
